 (auxiliary) fully established itself only during the 19th century, however."]],"senses":[[989,"worden","verb","past participle of werden",0]],"inflections":[["worden","werden","participle,past"]]},"hammerwurfe":{"inflections":[["hammerwurfe","hammerwurf","dative,singular"]]},"miet":{"inflections":[["miet","mieten","imperative,second-person,singular"]]},"parteivorsitzendem":{"inflections":[["parteivorsitzendem","parteivorsitzender","dative,singular,strong"]]}}}